Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Draft operational labeling instructions with examples, counterexamples, and uncertainty handling. Separate observable labels from inferred attributes, define adjudication, and test whether independent annotators can apply the rule consistently.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
